title Vinyl queue, 480x320 (draft Queue-480x320): the play order from the playing track, the four buttons
sizes 480x320
ppmm 608
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_PAGE queue

wait 1200
shot queue
expect esc
expect text "3 OF 20, 1 H 24 MIN LEFT"
expect text "Move up"
expect text "Clear all"
expect text "Amerie, 1 Thing (Siik Remix)"
key down
wait 200
tap "Move up"
wait 400
shot queue-moved
expect noquit
